{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who says you can\u2019t have fun in a zombie apocalypse?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, you\u2019ll blast zombies with crazy guns, tag the city with awesome graffitis, take down freaky zombies, and face off against a monstrous boss zombie. Pick your favorite hero from the squad, explore the city, raid the dumpsters, and watch zombie heads go kaboom with killer headshot animations.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/6c6e112ccb91699b336248822fed9bb0.avif?t=1761164856\" width=616 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/7963cb4b1ef69f1836ba11afbfd89cf0.poster.avif?t=1761164856\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/7963cb4b1ef69f1836ba11afbfd89cf0.webm?t=1761164856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four young mutants, each with their own powers and playstyle, ready to blast some zombies! Pick your favorite (or the one with the collest look) and go wild!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/0ff6d3f165d045527ce3ea4302aa1625.avif?t=1761164856\" width=616 height=78 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/d14465ac72969a95cc467e9c49a4490f.poster.avif?t=1761164856\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/d14465ac72969a95cc467e9c49a4490f.webm?t=1761164856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Ketchup Blaster, a Gumball Shooter, a Shark-Head Shotgun, and even a Witch\u2019s Broom \u2014 you\u2019ll find all sorts of crazy guns to make zombies deeply regret their life (and death) choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/7f6276127d1a7baf8c146db958a41638.avif?t=1761164856\" width=616 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/bc089b670e8f7d586bccb22c3dc4a371.poster.avif?t=1761164856\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/bc089b670e8f7d586bccb22c3dc4a371.webm?t=1761164856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The writer definitely went off the rails here. Expect cute puppy zombies, tentacle-armed chonks, jacked-up cop zombies, and even an\u00a0 Frankenstein with underwear. It doesn\u2019t make much sense, but hey \u2014 it\u2019s hilarious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/74fed60d7408852bdeddaf60d6e66692.avif?t=1761164856\" width=616 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/0727dec83ca354d295011daf2ea843e8.poster.avif?t=1761164856\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/0727dec83ca354d295011daf2ea843e8.webm?t=1761164856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Painting graffiti in a zombie apocalypse isn\u2019t easy. Every time you try to tag a wall, you might just summon an entire horde of the undead. Art has never been so dangerous (or colorful)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/70af412dc3aa5797303df9165e4828e9.avif?t=1761164856\" width=616 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/9df68d9bef3dfc604042f2e20a12b425.poster.avif?t=1761164856\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/9df68d9bef3dfc604042f2e20a12b425.webm?t=1761164856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This zombie clearly had a different breakfast. It\u2019s stronger, meaner, and keeps coming back stronger each time. Beat the Boss Zombie and show it who\u2019s the real monster here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3047820?t=1761164856","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761164856","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/e6caf0a18e94cd89ddddcb530370f80558c00ec8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761164856","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/e6caf0a18e94cd89ddddcb530370f80558c00ec8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761164856","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3419980,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who says you can\u2019t have fun in a zombie apocalypse?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, you\u2019ll blast zombies with crazy guns, tag the city with awesome graffitis, take down freaky zombies, and face off against a monstrous boss zombie. Pick your favorite hero from the squad, explore the city, raid the dumpsters, and watch zombie heads go kaboom with killer headshot animations.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/6c6e112ccb91699b336248822fed9bb0.avif?t=1761164856\" width=616 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/7963cb4b1ef69f1836ba11afbfd89cf0.poster.avif?t=1761164856\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/7963cb4b1ef69f1836ba11afbfd89cf0.webm?t=1761164856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four young mutants, each with their own powers and playstyle, ready to blast some zombies! Pick your favorite (or the one with the collest look) and go wild!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/0ff6d3f165d045527ce3ea4302aa1625.avif?t=1761164856\" width=616 height=78 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/d14465ac72969a95cc467e9c49a4490f.poster.avif?t=1761164856\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/d14465ac72969a95cc467e9c49a4490f.webm?t=1761164856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Ketchup Blaster, a Gumball Shooter, a Shark-Head Shotgun, and even a Witch\u2019s Broom \u2014 you\u2019ll find all sorts of crazy guns to make zombies deeply regret their life (and death) choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/7f6276127d1a7baf8c146db958a41638.avif?t=1761164856\" width=616 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/bc089b670e8f7d586bccb22c3dc4a371.poster.avif?t=1761164856\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/bc089b670e8f7d586bccb22c3dc4a371.webm?t=1761164856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The writer definitely went off the rails here. Expect cute puppy zombies, tentacle-armed chonks, jacked-up cop zombies, and even an\u00a0 Frankenstein with underwear. It doesn\u2019t make much sense, but hey \u2014 it\u2019s hilarious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/74fed60d7408852bdeddaf60d6e66692.avif?t=1761164856\" width=616 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/0727dec83ca354d295011daf2ea843e8.poster.avif?t=1761164856\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/0727dec83ca354d295011daf2ea843e8.webm?t=1761164856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Painting graffiti in a zombie apocalypse isn\u2019t easy. Every time you try to tag a wall, you might just summon an entire horde of the undead. Art has never been so dangerous (or colorful)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/70af412dc3aa5797303df9165e4828e9.avif?t=1761164856\" width=616 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/9df68d9bef3dfc604042f2e20a12b425.poster.avif?t=1761164856\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/9df68d9bef3dfc604042f2e20a12b425.webm?t=1761164856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This zombie clearly had a different breakfast. It\u2019s stronger, meaner, and keeps coming back stronger each time. Beat the Boss Zombie and show it who\u2019s the real monster here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Fogo Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/header.jpg?t=1761164856","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3047820/821425341/6ac5e6b9948de5c2415bc9c7a8a9e4624d33246a/1750970820/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746735144","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3047820/821425341/6ac5e6b9948de5c2415bc9c7a8a9e4624d33246a/1750970820/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746735144","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3047820/821425341/6ac5e6b9948de5c2415bc9c7a8a9e4624d33246a/1750970820/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1746735144","id":257034246,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257034246/movie480.mp4?t=1746735144","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257034246/movie_max.mp4?t=1746735144"},"name":"Ghetto Zombies - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257034246/dd7cb4cb771e6341fc78ae99435e483eb8851df2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746735144","webm":{"